OL,3,GNEWSAOrmer statue planning permission
OL,4,Arenewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlanning permission for a 4m (13ft)
OL,7,Ftall statue of a culinary delicacy has
OL,8,Fbeen renewed.
OL,10,FThe decision by Guernsey's Development
OL,11,Fand Planning Authority (DPA) means the
OL,12,Fcompany behind the project, The
OL,13,FGuernsey Ormer LBG, has three years to
OL,14,Fcomplete the development of the ormer
OL,15,Fat St Peter Port Harbour.
OL,17,FIn 2021, planning permission was
OL,18,Finitially granted for the giant ormer
OL,19,Fstatue but it had since lapsed.
OL,23,APub: 24-SepQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
