OL,3,GNEWSAOrmer statue planning permission
OL,4,Arenewed
OL,5,
OL,6,FThe statue will be placed at the end of
OL,7,FVictoria Pier in Guernsey's town
OL,8,Fcentre, which was one of the five sites
OL,9,Favailable for public ideas under the
OL,10,Fseafront enhancement project.
